@description Studio Graphite Console
@version 1.1.1
@changelog
  Include FeedTheCat's upstream MIT license notice for the Gridbox scaling code.
@provides
  [theme] ../Studio Graphite Console.ReaperThemeZip > Studio Graphite Console.ReaperThemeZip
  [script main=main] Studio Graphite Console - Open ReaBrowse.lua
  [script main=main] Studio Graphite Console - Open ReaDrumXT.lua
  [script main=main] Studio Graphite Console - Open ReaRoll.lua
  [script main=main] Studio Graphite Console - Open ReaSpect.lua
  [script main=main] Studio Graphite Console - Toggle Folder Annex.lua
  [script main=main] Studio Graphite Console - Toggle Mixer.lua
  [script main=main] Studio Graphite Console - Toggle TCP Folder Annex.lua
  [script main=main] Studio Graphite Console - Transport Buttons.lua
  [script main=main] Studio Graphite Console - Input Quantize.lua
  [script main=main] Studio Graphite Console - Mixer Folder Footer.lua
  [script nomain] Studio Graphite Console - TCP Folder Annex Renderer.lua
  [script nomain] lib/app_launcher.lua
  [script nomain] lib/theme_bindings.lua
  [script nomain] lib/theme_appearance.lua
  [script nomain] lib/theme_files.lua
  [script nomain] lib/gridbox_placement.lua
@about
  Select Studio Graphite Console from Options > Themes after installing.
  ReaImGui 0.10 or later is required for Transport Buttons settings.
  js_ReaScriptAPI supports both Folder Annexes, app window focus, FTC dockers and Gridbox, and Shift-click iQ.
  SWS/S&M Extension is required for the mixer Folder Annex and docked Mixer focus.
  Install the optional docker and Gridbox scripts from the FTC Tools repository.
  The README has the font downloads and the optional Folder Annex startup setup.
